      ],
      "source": "https://explore.localfirstaz.com/holbrook/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Navajo County Historical Society runs the historic courthouse museum, where artifacts tell the story of Holbrook’s frontier past.",
